{"result":"{
  "id": "18552",
  "key": "SFCC-275",
  "summary": "Cart Page – Button Group",
  "description": "**As a** Shopper, I want to see a clear group of checkout actions in my cart, so that I can proceed to checkout using my preferred payment method.\n\nThis is a **PWA Kit UI component story** covering the button group within the cart summary component (SFCC-816). The button group consists of three buttons rendered in a fixed stacked order: Checkout CTA (primary), Apple Pay Express (secondary), and Google Pay Express (secondary).\n\n**Checkout CTA** — the primary checkout action. All domestic storefronts direct to the same SFCC checkout entry page. For international storefronts, clicking Checkout directs the customer to an intermediate login page before being handed off to Global-e - see [SFCC-880](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-880)  (International Storefront Intermediate Login Page).\n\n**Apple Pay Express** — express checkout via Apple Pay. The Apple Pay integration, browser detection, and show/hide logic based on device/browser eligibility or region are covered in the Payments epic (SFCC-383) — not this story.\n\n**Google Pay Express** — express checkout via Google Pay. The Google Pay integration, browser detection, and show/hide logic based on device/browser eligibility or region are covered in the Payments epic (SFCC-384) — not this story.\n\n**Image for reference (Figma is leading):**\n\nDomestic:\n\n![\"image-20260908-033437.png\"](image-20260908-033437.png)\n\n\n\nInternational:\n\n![\"image-20260908-033532.png\"](image-20260908-033532.png)",
